  "file": [
   {
    "percorso": "guard.gd",
    "contenuto": "extends Sprite2D\n\n@export var speed: float = 120.0\n@export var target_position: Vector2 = Vector2.ZERO\n\n\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar direction: Vector2 = get_direction_to_target(target_position)\n\tif direction != Vector2.ZERO:\n\t\trotation = direction.angle()\n\tglobal_position = step_toward(target_position, speed * delta)\n\n\nfunc get_direction_to_target(target: Vector2) -> Vector2:\n\treturn global_position.direction_to(target)\n\n\nfunc step_toward(target: Vector2, delta_distance: float) -> Vector2:\n\treturn global_position.move_toward(target, delta_distance)\n"
   },
   {
    "percorso": "player.gd",
    "contenuto": "extends CharacterBody2D\n\n@export var max_speed: float = 200.0\n@export var acceleration: float = 1200.0\n@export var friction: float = 1000.0\n\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar input_direction: Vector2 = get_input_direction()\n\tupdate_velocity(input_direction, delta)\n\tmove_and_slide()\n\n\nfunc get_input_direction() -> Vector2:\n\treturn Input.get_vector(\"move_left\", \"move_right\", \"move_up\", \"move_down\")\n\n\nfunc update_velocity(direction: Vector2, delta: float) -> void:\n\tif direction != Vector2.ZERO:\n\t\tvar target_velocity: Vector2 = direction * max_speed\n\t\tvelocity = velocity.move_toward(target_velocity, acceleration * delta)\n\telse:\n\t\tvelocity = velocity.move_toward(Vector2.ZERO, friction * delta)\n"
   },
   {
    "percorso": "main.tscn",
    "contenuto": "[gd_scene format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Texture2D\" path=\"res://icon.svg\" id=\"1_icon\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://player.gd\" id=\"2_player\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://guard.gd\" id=\"3_guard\"]\n\n[node name=\"Main\" type=\"Node2D\"]\n\n[node name=\"Player\" type=\"CharacterBody2D\" parent=\".\"]\nposition = Vector2(200, 200)\nscript = ExtResource(\"2_player\")\n\n[node name=\"Sprite2D\" type=\"Sprite2D\" parent=\"Player\"]\ntexture = ExtResource(\"1_icon\")\n\n[node name=\"Guard\" type=\"Sprite2D\" parent=\".\"]\nposition = Vector2(100, 100)\ntexture = ExtResource(\"1_icon\")\nscript = ExtResource(\"3_guard\")\n"
   }
  ],
  "spiegazione": "Abbiamo convertito il nodo `Player` in un `CharacterBody2D` mantenendo l'aspetto visivo con un figlio `Sprite2D`. Nel codice abbiamo sostituito `_process()` con `_physics_process()`, usando la proprietà integrata `velocity` di `CharacterBody2D` e chiamando `move_and_slide()` senza moltiplicare per `delta`. Per rendere il movimento morbido, usiamo `move_toward()` applicando `acceleration` quando il giocatore preme una direzione e `friction` quando rilascia i tasti."
